*** Settings ***
Documentation       Technical helper keywords for the browser. Only here are keywords of the SeleniumLibrary used.
...                 Same names as with the Browser Library - tasks and assertions stay identical.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/abilities/selenium_ability.resource
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/pages/login_page.resource
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/pages/main_page.resource
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/pages/cart_page.resource
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/pages/settings_page.resource
Keyword Tags        interaction


*** Keywords ***
Launch Browser
    [Documentation]    Starts the browser with the configured size and speed.
    ...    Always without a window in the CI pipeline.
    IF    ${CI} or ${HEADLESS}
        Open Browser    about:blank    headless${BROWSER}
    ELSE
        Open Browser    about:blank    ${BROWSER}
    END
    Set Window Size    ${SCREEN_WIDTH}    ${SCREEN_HEIGHT}
    Set Selenium Speed    ${BROWSER_SPEED}

Close All Web Browsers
    [Documentation]    Closes all browser windows.
    Close All Browsers

Go To Address
    [Documentation]    Opens the address in the browser.
    [Arguments]    ${address}
    Go To    ${address}

Build Selector
    [Documentation]    Puts values into a selector with placeholders, e.g. {product}.
    [Arguments]    ${template}    &{values}
    ${selector}    Format String    ${template}    &{values}
    RETURN    ${selector}

Fill Field
    [Documentation]    Writes text into an input field.
    [Arguments]    ${selector}    ${text}
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    ${selector}
    Input Text    ${selector}    ${text}

Fill Secret Field
    [Documentation]    Writes a secret value (e.g. a password) into a field without writing it to the log.
    [Arguments]    ${selector}    ${secret}
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    ${selector}
    Input Password    ${selector}    ${secret}

Click On
    [Documentation]    Clicks an element as soon as it is clickable.
    [Arguments]    ${selector}
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    ${selector}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    ${TIMEOUT}    200ms    Click Element    ${selector}

Wait For Text
    [Documentation]    Waits until the element shows exactly this text (at most ${TIMEOUT}).
    [Arguments]    ${selector}    ${text}
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    ${selector}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    ${TIMEOUT}    200ms    Element Text Should Be    ${selector}    ${text}

Wait For Text Part
    [Documentation]    Waits until the text of the element contains the part (at most ${TIMEOUT}).
    [Arguments]    ${selector}    ${part}
    Wait Until Element Contains    ${selector}    ${part}

Wait For Element Count
    [Documentation]    Waits until exactly this many elements match the selector (at most ${TIMEOUT}).
    [Arguments]    ${selector}    ${count}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    ${TIMEOUT}    200ms    Page Should Contain Element    ${selector}    limit=${count}

Wait For Visible Element
    [Documentation]    Waits until the element is visible.
    [Arguments]    ${selector}
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    ${selector}

Wait For Address Part
    [Documentation]    Waits until the address in the browser contains the part.
    [Arguments]    ${part}
    Wait Until Location Contains    ${part}
